#. module: send_mail_on_reconciliation
#: model:mail.template,body_html:send_mail_on_reconciliation.email_template_invoice_paid
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin: 0px; padding: "
"0px; font-size: 13px;\">Dear customer,&nbsp;</p><p style=\"box-sizing:"
"border-box;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"<br><br>  \n"
"We would like to thank you for your payment&nbsp;for <span style=\"font-"
"weight:bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\"></span>,\n"
"                        Please find your paid invoice in the attached."
"<br>We express our gratitude for the trust you place in us.<br><br>Best "
"regards,&nbsp;<br><br>    Bang&amp;Olufsen Brussels \n"
"<br> \n"
"Bang&amp;Olufsen Liège\n"
"<br> \n"
"Bang&amp;Olufsen Mechelen\n"
"<br> \n"
"SIT Consulting &amp; Finance BV/SRL </p></div>"
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin: 0px; padding: "
"0px; font-size: 13px;\">Beste klant,&nbsp;</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-"
"box;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"<br><br>        \n"
"Wij danken u voor uw betaling&nbsp;voor <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" t-"
"out=\"object.name or ''\"></span>,\n"
"                       <br>Gelieve uw betaalde factuur in de bijlage te "
"vinden.<br>Wij waarderen het vertrouwen dat u in ons stelt. <br><br>Met "
"vriendelijk groeten,&nbsp;<br><br>     Bang&amp;Olufsen Brussels \n"
"<br> \n"
"Bang&amp;Olufsen Liège\n"
"<br> \n"
"Bang&amp;Olufsen Mechelen\n"
"<br><br> \n"
"SIT Consulting & Finance BV/SRL "

#. module: send_mail_on_reconciliation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:send_mail_on_reconciliation.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"As soon as a customer invoice is marked as paid, an email is sent to inform "
"the customer that their payment has been "
"received.                             However, emails are not sent for "
"invoices generated through the point-of-sale application."
msgstr ""
"Zodra een klantfactuur is gemarkeerd als betaald, wordt er een e-mail "
"verzonden om de klant te informeren dat de betaling is "
"ontvangen.                             Er worden echter geen e-mails "
"verzonden voor facturen die via de kassatoepassing zijn gegenereerd."

